WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.491
Real assets can be difficult to access. High minimums, complex structures and unclear ownership can make opportunities difficult to understand.

00:00:11.571 --> 00:00:19.063
Mizant connects the full journey. SMEs, originators, investors and independent reviewers work through one structured opportunity lifecycle.

00:00:19.143 --> 00:00:26.634
Evidence begins with the asset. The business need, productive asset and supporting documents are prepared as a controlled submission.

00:00:26.714 --> 00:00:34.206
Independent review stays visible. Legal, risk, compliance and Shariah decisions remain separate, attributable and connected to the reviewed version.

00:00:34.286 --> 00:00:41.777
Investors see rights and risks. Opportunity pages explain the asset, parties, cash-flow source, key risks and evidence status before any next step.

00:00:41.857 --> 00:00:49.349
Tokenisation follows approval. Digital units are prepared only after human gates, fixed-supply checks and maker-checker approval.

00:00:49.429 --> 00:00:56.920
Ownership remains reconcilable. Digital records connect to the controlled ownership register and a complete audit trail.
